& [ConfirmedCommandPlan: IR6CoordinationMailboxProjection] is the command and verification plan for future implementation slices
  + [baseline_compile_command] is python -m compileall -q src tests
  + [baseline_test_command] is python -m unittest discover -s tests
  + [targeted_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_ir6_coordination_mailbox_contracts
  + [diff_hygiene_command] is git diff --check
  + [generated_output_review] is prove generated projections and reports are ignored, disposable, reproducible, and non-authoritative
  + [mailbox_io_review] is prove platform mailboxes, inbox directories, message files, read cursors, and carrier state are not created or mutated by projection code or tests

  = must: run baseline tests and diff hygiene after every future slice
  = should: run compile check after code slices begin
  = must: run targeted contract tests once tests.test_ir6_coordination_mailbox_contracts exists

